OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with isolated showers on        
OL,7,FMonday. Cloudier through Tuesday with  
OL,8,Fstrengthening winds and rain in the    
OL,9,Fwest. Cloudy, breezy with rain on      
OL,10,FWednesday. Temperatures just below     
OL,11,Faverage.                               
